    "It didn't pass review or was hidden after reports. Others can't see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未通过审核，或因被举报而隐藏。其他人看不到它。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "審査を通らなかったか、通報により非表示になりました。ほかの人には見えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It disappears from the world map for everyone and becomes private again. The post used this month is not given back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会从所有人的世界地图上消失并恢复为私密。本月已用的公开次数不会返还。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべての人のワールドマップから消え、非公開に戻ります。今月使った公開回数は戻りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was hidden for now after several reports and is being checked again. Only you can see it until then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因被多人举报暂时隐藏，正在重新审核。在此之前只有你能看到。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複数の報告により一時的に非表示になり、再審査中です。それまではあなただけが見られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its image file is missing or damaged." : {
